{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments [{:quotes [{:he "איש לפי אכלו", :translit "ish lefi okhlo", :gloss "each man according to his eating"} {:he "אכל כזית", :translit "okhal kazayit", :gloss "eat an olive's bulk"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :gematria, :a "איש לפי אכלו", :b "אכל כזית"}], :frame {:text "The minimum quantity for fulfilling the obligation of eating the Paschal lamb is a ke-zayit, an olive's bulk (Shabbat 73a, Berakhot 44a in the context of the olive measure). The verse 'איש לפי אכלו' literally speaks of each man's portion, and by gematria it alludes to this halakhic measure.", :sources ["Shabbat 73a" "Berakhot 44a"]}} {:quotes [{:he "תכוסו על השה שה תמים", :translit "techuseu al haseh seh tamim", :gloss "you shall be counted to the lamb, a lamb without blemish"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :masorah, :count 2, :occurrences ["שה" "שה"]}], :frame {:text "When the Paschal lamb is insufficient for all those registered, a supplementary offering called the ḥagigah is brought alongside it (Mishnah Zevaḥim 10:1). The word 'שה' appears twice in the phrase 'תכוסו עד השה שה תמים' (Exodus 12:5), alluding to these two lambs — one for the Pesach and one for the ḥagigah.", :sources ["Exodus 12:5" "Mishnah Zevaḥim 10:1"]}}], :arithmetic [{:kind :gematria, :a "איש לפי אכלו", :a-value 488, :b "אכל כזית", :b-value 488, :lens :standard, :by :selah, :equal? true} {:kind :masorah, :count 2, :occurrences ["שה" "שה"], :by :selah, :located [{:phrase "שה", :refs ["Genesis 30:32" "Exodus 12:3" "Exodus 12:5" "Exodus 21:37" "Exodus 22:3" "Exodus 22:8" "Exodus 22:9" "Leviticus 5:7"], :n 21, :lens :exact} {:phrase "שה", :refs ["Genesis 30:32" "Exodus 12:3" "Exodus 12:5" "Exodus 21:37" "Exodus 22:3" "Exodus 22:8" "Exodus 22:9" "Leviticus 5:7"], :n 21, :lens :exact}]}], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :discipline "bht-chalkboard-v1", :timestamp "2026-07-12T23:15:04.247307216Z", :model "glm-5.2"}